@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
left to right direction
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
title RIASEC source-defined storage / workspace V72 / 2026-11-18
class Account {
  account_id: UUID [PK; reference stub]
}
class RiasecWorkspace {
  organization_id: UUID [PK]
  account_id: UUID [PK, FK account]
  draft_id: UUID [nullable]
  answers: JSONB [required; default {}]
  revision: BIGINT [required; default 0]
  editor_id: UUID [nullable]
  updated_at: TIMESTAMPTZ [required]
}
class RiasecResult {
  result_id: UUID [PK; submitted draft UUID]
  organization_id: UUID [FK owner pair]
  account_id: UUID [FK owner pair]
  answers: JSONB [required]
  scores: JSONB [required; six raw 0..40]
  instrument_version: TEXT [required]
  scoring_version: TEXT [required]
  submitted_at: TIMESTAMPTZ [required]
  deleted_at: TIMESTAMPTZ [nullable]
  ai_status: TEXT [required; four-state check]
  ai_deadline: TIMESTAMPTZ [required]
  run_id: UUID [required; completion fence]
  model: TEXT [nullable]
  prompt_version: TEXT [nullable]
  recommendations: JSONB [nullable]
  failure_code: TEXT [nullable]
}
class JobPosition {
  id: String
  organizationId: String
  code / name / description / status
  interestRealistic: Integer [0..40, optional]
  interestInvestigative: Integer [0..40, optional]
  interestArtistic: Integer [0..40, optional]
  interestSocial: Integer [0..40, optional]
  interestEnterprising: Integer [0..40, optional]
  interestConventional: Integer [0..40, optional]
}
RiasecWorkspace --> Account : account_id FK
RiasecResult --> RiasecWorkspace : composite owner FK
JobPosition ..> RiasecResult : metadata/profile copied into JSON; NOT FK
note bottom of RiasecWorkspace
  Table: platform.riasec_workspace
  One owner row; one optional non-expiring draft.
  No instrument-version/manifest archive column.
end note
note bottom of RiasecResult
  Table: platform.riasec_result
  Current = newest active submitted_at/result_id, not a pointer.
  Inactive: recover within 7 days, or explicit permanent delete.
  JSON object checks: answers and scores; workspace answers.
  Indexes: owner + submitted_at/result_id; queued jobs; deleted_at.
end note
note bottom of JobPosition
  Neo4j only; six interests all present or all absent on explicit save.
  Demo/organization values; not normalized official O*NET ratings.
end note
@enduml
